---
smd: 2
title: Rules outside the section
---

:::constraint{#CTOP}
Keep every change behind a feature flag.
:::

## Platform

:::constraint{#CPARENT}
Platform code never calls the billing API directly.
:::

### Storage

:::requirement{#RSTORE}
Store uploads in the regional bucket.
:::

## Policies

:::constraint{#CDOC scope=document}
Log every write with the request id.
:::

## Billing

:::constraint{#CBILL}
Billing changes need a second reviewer.
:::

:::constraint{#CON applies-to=RBILL}
Invoices round half to even.
:::

:::requirement{#RBILL}
Send the invoice on the first day of the month.
:::
